  "body": "- Opening BatteryGuard again (for example from Applications) now opens its panel.\n- If your menu bar is full and the icon is hidden behind the camera notch, the panel still opens and explains how to make room.\n- The app now checks that the background service is really alive. If it isn't responding, you'll see what went wrong and a Repair button, instead of being asked to turn on the limit again.\n\nUpdating from 1.0.2: install the new version, then click Repair if asked, or turn the limit off and on again. Your administrator password is needed once."
